+"""Experiment 4799: .441 S2 off-path trust-gate capstone.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-CAPSTONE-4799, SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4799,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4799-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4799-FIELD-PRINCIPLES.
+
+The scorecard is aggregation-only. It reads upstream artifacts through the
+patched artifact summarizer before importing fields, then decides whether S2
+structural energy beat the incumbent binary accuracy gate on held-out off-path
+cell recall. A stale conductor flag can be overridden only by a clean live
+summarizer re-check; a live-critical upstream is bounded and cannot authorize S3.
